<h3 id=3D"toc-hId--1580600965">&nbsp;</h3>
<h3 id=3D"toc-hId-162209370">Conclusion</h3>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>PROC R offers multiple ways to combine SAS and R. While embedding R code=
 directly in a SAS program is convenient, stand-alone R scripts and externa=
l R files can make your code more modular, reusable, and easier to maintain=
. Whether you keep your R code inside SAS or in separate files, PROC R prov=
ides a flexible framework for integrating both languages in a single workfl=
ow.</p>
